# Internal working record. Decision reasoning, rejected alternatives and costs
# are kept by the team and are not shipped with the schemas: five repositories
# pin this one, and none of them need our deliberation. docs/SPEC.md carries
# every decision that binds an implementer.
docs/DECISIONS.md

# Agent and editor instruction files. Local tooling configuration, not repository
# content. The durable engineering standards live in docs/REVIEW.md.
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
.claude/
.cursor/
.cursorrules
.aider*
.continue/
.windsurf/
.github/copilot-instructions.md

