# Local scratch. Anything worth keeping belongs in tools/ or conformance/.
scratch/
tmp/
*.local.*

# NOT ignored, deliberately:
#   gen/            generated, committed, and checked for drift in CI
#   Cargo.lock      the workspace ships binaries
#   go.sum          dependency pinning is part of the contract
